{{Unobtainable}}
'''Squish Ball Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was obtainable by clearing the stage [[None More Squishy]]. It was added in [[Version 2.8.1 Update|Version 2.8.1]]. This unit is obtainable on the [[The Battle Cats Unite!|Nintendo Switch version]] when viewing the Cat Storage for 5 minutes straight then clearing any stage.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 140
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Squish Ball Cat
|name2 = Muscleman Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Muscleman Cat '''at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Another [[Capsule Cat (Special Cat)|weak and expendable unit]] that dies way too quickly. The only thing worth noting is that Squish Ball Cat is speedy, has high cost and low stats, par for the course with most [[:Category:Collaboration Event Cats|Collaboration Event]] cats. Squish Ball Cat does have [[Area Attack]], but this unit is not meant for general usage outside of very early-game, like [[Empire of Cats]]. If you are using it, do not use its Evolved Form, as the only change if you do is a longer attack animation, slightly hurting this unit's mobility and DPS. The impact is minimal, but if Squish Ball Cat can be of any purpose, Muscleman Cat is a straight downgrade and should never be used. 

