==Trivia==
*Muscleman Cat is said to be a distant relative to [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]]. This is most likely a fact that they are both muscular, but they also have half-circle heads, with flatter chins and bigger foreheads.
*Muscleman Cat's description says "facsinated" instead of "fascinated".
*Squish Ball Cat was formerly unlocked by inputting a [[Serial Codes|Serial Code]] until the feature was removed in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]].
*Squish Ball Cat appearing in the English Version was a reward for players meeting the 2,000,000 view goal of the [[PONOS Campaigns/Cats 'Round The World|Cats 'Round the World]] campaign.
**In posters for the Cats 'Round the World campaign, Squish Ball Cat is mistakenly called both "The Squish Ball Cat" and "Squishball Cat".

